### **Scene Description in RDF Triples (Turtle Format)**
```turtle
@prefix ex: <http://example.org/autonomous-driving#> .
@prefix xsd: <http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#> .
@prefix rdf: <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#> .

ex:Scene1 a ex:NighttimeUrbanScene ;
    ex:hasWeatherCondition ex:RainyNight ;
    ex:hasRoadCondition ex:WetRoad .

ex:Vehicle1 a ex:Vehicle ;
    ex:isLocatedOn ex:RoadCurve ;
    ex:hasHeadlightsOn true ;
    ex:hasTrafficSignNearby ex:SpeedLimitSign .

ex:Vehicle2 a ex:Vehicle ;
    ex:isApproachingFrom ex:Left ;
    ex:isNear ex:Intersection .

ex:Streetlight1 a ex:Streetlight ;
    ex:illuminates ex:RoadCurve ;
    ex:createsGlare ex:High .

ex:SidewalkBarrier a ex:Barrier ;
    ex:adjacentTo ex:Sidewalk ;
    ex:separates ex:Road ex:Sidewalk .

ex:WetRoad a ex:RoadCondition ;
    ex:reducesTraction true ;
    ex:occludes ex:Obstacles .
```

